r's compensation, and the state to be corrected is the reversal. The ruling is DRIVER_COMPENSATION of 5.00 SGD; amount_sgd and driver_compensation_sgd both carry 5.00 — the figure the ruling moves. POL-NS-24 does not apply (the rider did not cancel, and the driver missed no deadline on a trip with no scheduled time). The POL-NS-25 repeat no-show referral is not engaged: the rider's no_show_cancellations_30d counter is not present on the profile (its no_show_disputes_30d is 0), far below the threshold of 3, so no referral issues.\n\nConfidence is 0.90. The deciding facts rest on artifacts at weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0; the 5.00 SGD contested is below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band, where POL-NS-26 makes the ruling final.",
